Subject: [PATCH] fix: remove full-page watermark, Ex Libris stamp top-right
 only

Drop the full-viewport background watermark (CSS background-image,
opacity, filters). Show the original ex-libris-watermark.png as a
small corner stamp: below the header on dashboard, top-right on auth.
Remove from header bar so it does not crowd sign out. Move toasts to
bottom-right to avoid overlap.
